WEBVTT

00:00.450 --> 00:03.610
There are questions the soul asks in silence.

00:03.650 --> 00:06.040
Why does the same thing keep happening to me?

00:06.840 --> 00:09.627
Another partner with the same ending.

00:09.667 --> 00:12.560
Another job with the same conflict.

00:12.600 --> 00:15.950
The same story, with a different person.

00:16.750 --> 00:19.310
It isn't bad luck, or chance.

00:19.350 --> 00:21.870
It's a film that took shape in you between

00:21.910 --> 00:23.937
the ages of two and ten,

00:23.977 --> 00:26.270
and that today is projected onto everything

00:26.310 --> 00:27.540
you live.

00:28.260 --> 00:30.300
The Holographic Code System,

00:30.340 --> 00:32.020
created by Isabel Elizalde,

00:32.060 --> 00:34.260
invites you to stop being a victim of your

00:34.300 --> 00:36.620
story, and to become a conscious

00:36.660 --> 00:39.370
observer of your own reality.

00:40.090 --> 00:42.370
Two days to look at your film,

00:42.410 --> 00:45.010
to let go of control, expectation and

00:45.050 --> 00:47.970
attachment, to understand authentic forgiveness,

00:48.010 --> 00:50.320
and to open yourself to Real Love.

00:51.040 --> 00:52.680
These are not lectures.

00:52.720 --> 00:54.240
It is living work,

00:54.280 --> 00:56.800
in a circle, where you recognize yourself as you listen

00:56.840 --> 00:57.990
to others.

00:58.790 --> 01:00.630
We don't promise miracles.

01:00.670 --> 01:03.630
We offer you a space to come back to yourself.

01:03.670 --> 01:06.030
A process complete in itself:

01:06.070 --> 01:09.420
it begins here, and it can end here.

01:10.140 --> 01:13.420
Intensive Workshop. October tenth and eleventh.

01:13.460 --> 01:15.100
In person and online.

01:15.140 --> 01:16.850
We look forward to seeing you at INISCH.
